        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Neha Sharma, Vivek Oberoi\n- Works: Jayantabhai Ki Luv Story\n- Places: Bihar, Bhagalpur, New Delhi\n- Organizations: Mount Carmel School, National Institute of Fashion Technology\n- Roles: actress, model\n\nFacts:\n- Neha Sharma was born on 21 November 1987.\n- Neha Sharma is an Indian film actress and model.\n- Neha Sharma is a native of Bihar.\n- Neha Sharma attended Mount Carmel School in Bhagalpur.\n- Neha Sharma pursued a course in fashion design from the National Institute of Fashion Technology in New Delhi.\n- In Jayantabhai Ki Luv Story, Vivek Oberoi and Neha Sharma played the lead roles opposite each other.",
